  "statement": "Given an array of meeting intervals where each interval is represented as [start, end], determine the minimum number of meeting rooms required to accommodate all meetings without any time conflicts.\n\nTwo meetings conflict if one starts before the other ends. A meeting that ends at time t does not conflict with a meeting that starts at time t.",
